- **router16**: Only `zebra`, `mgmtd`, and `staticd` are running — **`ospfd` is absent** from the process list entirely. `frr.conf` is empty — no OSPF process, no interface config, nothing was retained after maintenance.
- **mswitch0**: Its own `ospfd` is running but has **zero OSPF neighbors** (the adjacency with router16 has already dropped). The kernel still has stale `proto ospf` routes pointing to `10.2.2.1` (router16), explaining the intermittent behaviour — traffic gets black-holed at router16 until those routes age out.
- **router7**: Has no route to any of the Campus 1 subnets (`172.16.10.0/24`, `172.16.20.0/24`, `172.16.30.0/24`, `10.2.2.0/24`) — router16 never re-advertised them.

